@startuml BossDecisionSequence
' AesirWarden · high-level interface contract · 2026-09-29
' Runtime PPO branch and failure injection remain unverified in this project.
title AesirWarden - Boss 高层决策与共享执行
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
actor "决策时机" as Tick
participant "Observation" as Obs
participant "BT 或 Policy Client" as Policy
participant "Boss Action Component" as Action
participant "GAS ASC / GA" as GAS
participant "Telemetry" as Tel

Tick -> Obs : 构造 v4 观察
Obs --> Policy : 26 特征及动作可用性
Policy -> Action : EAesirBossAction + Target
Action -> Action : 权威/目标/状态/配置检查
alt 合法
  Action -> GAS : CanActivate / TryActivateAbilityByClass
  GAS --> Action : 成功或 GAS 拒绝
else 本地检查拒绝
  Action -> Action : typed 失败原因
end
Action --> Tel : ActionOutcome 与时间
GAS --> Tel : 伤害/终局事件
note over Policy,Tel
  BT 和 PPO 应共用此边界。
  完整 PPO Episode 与回退故障测试待验收。
end note
@enduml
